"test":{"name":"rule-supply-fob-refresh","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"supplyFob","question":"Supply around a forward base, and the board kept up to date. HQ at -13, FOB at 0 with a store. Nothing linking them: the FOB is cut off and gives from its store (the ground around it is supplied), and supply units standing there, or aboard a truck there, are cut off (a supply unit links only to supply that comes from the HQ). After each kind of move the supply shown on the board is the network as it is: a truck carrying supply units driven by the player (its supply moves with it), a supply unit walking, an enemy blocking a corridor killed; and a supply unit's cut-off flag (the cut-off icon) follows the network, not the start of the turn. Also reports whether an enemy Blue does not see, under fog, cuts Blue's supply.","rules":"standard"},
